# Motor Position FMU (CI)

This folder runs `Motor_Pos.fmu` using Python (FMPy) in GitHub Actions.

## Outputs
- `motor_pos_result.csv`
- `motor_pos_plot.png`

## CI
Workflow: `.github/workflows/motor_pos_ci.yml`

## Local run
```bash
pip install fmpy numpy pandas matplotlib
python Motor_Pos/run_motor_pos_fmu.py
python Motor_Pos/plot.py
